{"text": "We are now in Finsbury Park. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To see a painting by Banksy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> An internationally famous street artist. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Banksys artworks often carry social messages. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the green tree you see over there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is a good example. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As you can see. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He created a green tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By spraying green paint. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On a wall behind a leafless tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Next to the tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There is a person. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who is holding a sprayer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What message does Banksy want to give us. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through this painting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In many peoples opinion. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He is telling us. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That nature is having a hard time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They think. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He wants us to take better care of it.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "e", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "n", "o", "w", " ", "i", "n", " ", "F", "i", "n", "s", "b", "u", "r", "y", " ", "P", "a", "r", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "o", " ", "s", "e", "e", " ", "a", " ", "p", "a", "i", "n", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "b", "y", " ", "B", "a", "n", "k", "s", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", " ", "i", "n", "t", "e", "r", "n", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", "a", "l", "l", "y", " ", "f", "a", "m", "o", "u", "s", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", " ", "a", "r", "t", "i", "s", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "a", "n", "k", "s", "y", "s", " ", "a", "r", "t", "w", "o", "r", "k", "s", " ", "o", "f", "t", "e", "n", " 